*.key

# cloned third-party agent repos (studied locally, never commit)
/agent-browser/

# screenshot_task_suite deliverables: override the global *.md ignore so the
# binding spec and pilot docs are tracked (code/json are not *.md-ignored).
# Curated textual run RESULTS (task_result.json/steps.jsonl/summary.json/
# run_manifest.json/ANALYSIS.md) are committed via `git add -f`; the heavy
# screenshots/history.json/conversation binaries stay ignored under results/.
!screenshot_task_suite/DESIGN_RULES.md
!screenshot_task_suite/PILOT_TASKS.md
!screenshot_task_suite/Pilot tasks 2.0.md
!screenshot_task_suite/Task Design Plan.md